Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Light had to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.66,0:00:01.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,explain every name to L
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,before the notebook worked?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.24,0:00:04.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Mandatory peer review.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.54,0:00:05.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,This rule pauses entries.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:07.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Light gives a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.04,0:00:07.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,L can challenge it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:09.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,Terrible news for arrogance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:10.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Light says someone looks guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.78,0:00:12.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,My guy, cheekbone analysis isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:13.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,a criminal justice system.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:15.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then he cites online agreement.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.24,0:00:15.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,L asks for the original
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:17.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,report.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.02,0:00:18.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,The god complex needs a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:19.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,bibliography.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:20.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ryuk watches humans recreate a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:22.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,terrible university group\Nproject.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.66,0:00:23.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Somebody pass the apples.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:25.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Light tries a longer speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:26.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,Dramatic breathing doesn't make\Nguesses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.54,0:00:27.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Incredible discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:29.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,L compares the explanations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.94,0:00:31.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why does criticism suddenly\Ncount
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.20,0:00:32.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,as guilt?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Why is evidence optional?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.44,0:00:34.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Light's justice bends around his
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.66,0:00:35.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,ego.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:36.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Very convenient weather system.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.90,0:00:38.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bro appointed himself the whole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:38.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,forecast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,L isn't automatically correct\Neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.84,0:00:42.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,Both geniuses can miss evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.60,0:00:44.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,The notebook doesn't delete\Nuncertainty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.23,0:00:45.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Their duel becomes defending\Nconclusions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.61,0:00:47.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,instead of delivering smug\Nindoor
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:49.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,monologues with stationery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.23,0:00:50.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,Ryuk asks when they'll finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.83,0:00:52.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,L requests supporting documents.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:53.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,Supernatural horror has become\Nan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.89,0:00:54.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,academic hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.85,0:00:56.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,Light wanted unquestioned\Nauthority.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:57.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,His final boss is somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.59,0:00:59.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,calmly asking for evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.57,0:01:00.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Source, bro. Show the source.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.45,Heading,,0,0,0,,JUSTICE NEEDS A SOURCE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.45,0:00:09.22,Heading,,0,0,0,,A DIFFERENT NOTEBOOK RULE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.22,0:00:13.57,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE FIRST EXCUSE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.57,0:00:18.88,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE FOLLOW UP QUESTION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.88,0:00:23.62,Heading,,0,0,0,,RYUK BOUGHT FRONT ROW SEATS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.62,0:00:28.31,Heading,,0,0,0,,CONFIDENCE IS NOT PROOF
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.31,0:00:33.38,Heading,,0,0,0,,FOLLOW THE CONTRADICTION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.38,0:00:38.79,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE MASK STARTS SLIPPING
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.79,0:00:44.23,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE REAL CHANGE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.23,0:00:49.20,Heading,,0,0,0,,A DIFFERENT KIND OF DUEL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.20,0:00:54.78,Heading,,0,0,0,,EVEN THE SHINIGAMI IS TIRED
Dialogue: 1,0:00:54.78,0:01:01.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE FINAL BOSS IS CITATIONS
